        {
          "name": "Sandblast",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "A cave antlion can stir up the sand around it to blast sand at its enemies within a 30-ft.-radius. Creatures within the area of effect must make a Fortitude save (DC 18) or be inflicted with Blind status for 1d4 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 2nd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 19).",
          "notes": {
